{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204230","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1320423001:0":{"text":"온도차 탐지기를 써봤지만, 아무런 반응이 없었다.","source_cn":"你们尝试着使用温差探测器，它却没有任何反应","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x023636E7B3B3220F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320423002:0":{"text":"이상하네요. 탐지기가 반응하지 않아요. 소리도 안 나고, 화면도 꺼져 있어요!","source_cn":"奇怪，探测器怎么没反应了？不仅没有声音，显示屏也不亮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3DE23FF57A598C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320423003:0":{"text":"음? 어디 볼까요.","source_cn":"嗯？让我瞧瞧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCA01CF07EA5B4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320423004:1":{"text":"...고장 났네요. 뒤쪽에 얼음 송곳이 관통한 흔적이 있어요.","source_cn":"……探测器似乎损坏了，背面有被冰锥穿透的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F880F564EFFC6DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320423005:0":{"text":"어, 어쩌다...!","source_cn":"怎……怎么会这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAC90E54515129ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320423006:0":{"text":"아까 전투가 너무 치열해서 망가질 수밖에 없었을 거예요.","source_cn":"唉，刚才的战斗那么激烈，难免有东西会被损坏，这也正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADCB22167D3E1DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320423007:0":{"text":"하지만 이러면 온천을 찾을 수가 없는데...","source_cn":"可是这样的话，我们就没办法找温泉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x358C062FE4656ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320423008:0":{"text":"어머, 괜찮아요. 저는 그렇게 나약하지 않답니다.","source_cn":"好啦，亲爱的，我可没有这么脆弱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F4F08C83D3915A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320423009:0":{"text":"탐지기가 없어도 괜찮아요! 항상 하던 대로 찾으면 되니까요. 그저 시간이 조금 더 걸릴 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"没有探测器也没事！大不了用我的老方法找温泉，也不过是要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41FB1D885A1B7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1320423009":{"text":"탐지기가 없어도 괜찮아요! 항상 하던 대로 찾으면 되니까요. 그저 시간이 조금 더 걸릴 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"没有探测器也没事！大不了用我的老方法找温泉，也不过是要多花点时间而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD41FB1D885A1B7B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320423011:0":{"text":"처음 여관의 온천을 찾을 때도 제 천부적인 후각과 시력의 덕을 톡톡히 보았답니다.","source_cn":"想当初，我可是凭着天生敏锐的嗅觉和视力，就找到了旅店现...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3E460FA124C5FA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"처음 여관의 온천을 찾을 때도 제 천부적인 후각과 시력의 덕을 톡톡히 보았답니다.","female":"처음 여관의 온천을 찾을 때도 제 천부적인 후각과 시력의 덕을 톡톡히 보았답니다.","variant_male_record_index":"145574","variant_female_record_index":"145575","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320423012:0":{"text":"후각과 시력만으로 찾을 수 있다고요?","source_cn":"只通过嗅觉和视力就能找到吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C638FB433A23BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320423013:0":{"text":"맞아요. 마침 그때 큰 눈이 내린 후였는데, 산에 들어갔을 때 수증기가 올라오는 걸 보고 유황 냄새를 맡았답니다. 그렇게 찾다 보니 온천을 발견했지요.","source_cn":"没错。当时是在一场大雪之后，我进山采东西时看到了水汽升...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62EAB194265ECDDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320423014:1":{"text":"운이 좋기도 했지만, 제 눈과 코 덕분이기도 해요!","source_cn":"虽说也有运气的成分在，但我的眼睛和鼻子也功不可没！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C9ABB3E73CB225D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320423015:0":{"text":"이제 온천 찾기는 저에게 맡기고 여러분은 따라오시기만 하면 돼요!","source_cn":"接下来，寻找温泉的事就交给我吧，你们只需要跟着我走就行了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x603076C58BB3F716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320423016:0":{"text":"네! 저와 치피도 열심히 냄새를 맡아서 도와드릴게요!","source_cn":"嗯，我和满满也会用嗅觉一起帮你找温泉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE418DCFCDBF32228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320423017:0":{"text":"좋아요. 미리 고맙다고 해둘까요?","source_cn":"好啊，那我就提前谢谢你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C2227BE2C12E311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320423018:0":{"text":"하지만 이렇게 찾는 건 시간이 얼마나 걸릴지 몰라요. 그러니 먼저 <style=\"highlight\">여관으로 돌아가서</style> 잠깐 쉬도록 해요.","source_cn":"只不过用这个老方法的话，说不准要花多少时间呢。我们先<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAFF77B2DFCE7177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"항상 하던 대로?","source_cn":"什么老方法？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C09A385D30B3AA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"항상 하던 대로?","female":"항상 하던 대로?","variant_male_record_index":"68692","variant_female_record_index":"68693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320423010:0":{"text":"하하, 그건 효율이 너무 떨어지죠!","source_cn":"哈哈，那效率可是够低的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3758D1598E79BD2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하하, 그건 효율이 너무 떨어지죠!","female":"하하, 그건 효율이 너무 떨어지죠!","variant_male_record_inde